# Grokathon constraints

- Use **only Grok** via xAI (`https://api.x.ai/v1`, `XAI_API_KEY`). Do not add Claude, OpenAI, Gemini, or other LLM providers.
- Tobi owns `bot/` (iMessage + Grok agent). Otis owns backend/app. Arden owns website.
- Prefer stub backend (`USE_STUB_BACKEND=true`) until Otis API is live; keep tool names stable: `resolve_club`, `find_paths`, `draft_intro`, `send_message`, `lookup_user`.
- System prompt lives in `bot/src/nepo_bot/prompts/system.md`.
- No Campus Shape references. Keep student-voice drafts, not recruiter voice.
